"8\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Query matrix</text>\n  <rect x=\"148\" y=\"134\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(123,47,255,0.14)\" stroke=\"rgba(123,47,255,0.45)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#glow2)\"/>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#A78BFA\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\" font-weight=\"800\">K</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(167,139,250,0.6)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Key matrix</text>\n  <rect x=\"148\" y=\"164\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(52,211,153,0.14)\" stroke=\"rgba(52,211,153,0.45)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#glow2)\"/>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#34D399\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\" font-weight=\"800\">V</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(52,211,153,0.6)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Value matrix</text>\n  <line x1=\"228\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#00D4FF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"228\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#7B2FFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2p)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"128\" width=\"110\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.08)\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n  <text x=\"335\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67E8F9\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">QK&#7488; / &#8730;d_k</text>\n  <text x=\"335\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(103,232,249,0.55)\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">attention scores</text>\n  <text x=\"335\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(103,232,249,0.4)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\">softmax [0,1]</text>\n  <line x1=\"390\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#00D4FF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"228\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#34D399\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2g)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"432\" y=\"130\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(123,47,255,0.1)\" stroke=\"rgba(123,47,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n  <text x=\"482\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#C4B5FD\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">Attention(Q,K,V)</text>\n  <text x=\"482\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(196,181,253,0.55)\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">weighted value sum</text>\n  <text x=\"560\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.45)\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\">HEADS (parallel)</text>\n  <line x1=\"532\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"556\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"532\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"556\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"532\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"556\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"558\" y=\"78\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.1)\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"588\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67E8F9\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\">Head 1</text>\n  <rect x=\"558\" y=\"138\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.08)\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"588\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67E8F9\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\">Head 2</text>\n  <rect x=\"558\" y=\"198\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.08)\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"588\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67E8F9\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\">Head h</text>\n  <text x=\"588\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.3)\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui\">&#8942;</text>\n  <line x1=\"618\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"618\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"618\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr2)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"662\" y=\"128\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.1)\" stroke=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.35)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#glow2)\"/>\n  <text x=\"707\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00D4FF\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">Concat</text>\n  <text x=\"707\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.6)\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">+ Linear W_O</text>\n  <text x=\"707\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.45)\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">output</text>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"270\" width=\"760\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.07)\" stroke=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FCD34D\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\">KV Cache: at inference, K and V matrices are cached per token. Memory cost = 2 x layers x heads x d_k x seq_len x 2 bytes</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(252,211,77,0.55)\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,monospace\">GPT-4 class (96L, 128H, d_k=128, 8192 seq): approx 51 GB per request — why most teams underestimate GPU RAM by 3-5x</text>\n</svg>\n<p class=\"blog-nexus-diagram__caption\">The multi-head attention mechanism: input tokens are projected into Q, K, V matrices, attention scores are computed via QK-transpose/sqrt(d_k) scaled dot-product, then softmaxed and multiplied by V. Multiple heads run in parallel, each learning different relational patterns. The KV Cache stores computed K/V tensors during autoregressive generation — its memory footprint is why large context windows require careful infrastructure planning.</p>\n</div><p>You don't need to train an LLM to benefit from understanding how they work. But you do need to understand the architecture if you want to make rational decisions about context window sizing, inference cost, model selection, and latency optimization. The teams that treat LLMs as black-box APIs consistently make expensive architectural mistakes.</p><h2>The KV Cache: What Inference Actually Costs</h2><div class=\"blog-callout blog-callout--insight\"><strong>KV Cache Memory Formula</strong><pre><code>memory = 2 x num_layers x num_heads x d_k x seq_len x batch_size x 2 bytes\n\n# GPT-4 class model (96 layers, 128 heads, d_k=128), seq=8192, batch=1:\n# = 2 x 96 x 128 x 128 x 8192 x 1 x 2 = ~51 GB per request</code></pre><p>This is why serving large context windows at scale requires specialized infrastructure — and why most teams underestimate GPU memory requirements by 3–5x.</p></div><h2>Attention Mechanisms: The Comparison Matrix</h2><div class=\"blog-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"blog-comparison-table\"><thead><tr><th>Mechanism</th><th>Memory per Layer</th><th>Inference Speed</th><th>Used By</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MHA (Multi-Head Attention)</td><td>High</td><td>Baseline</td><td>GPT-4, original BERT</td></tr><tr><td>MQA (Multi-Query Attention)</td><td>Low</td><td class=\"winner\">Fastest</td><td>Falcon, early Gemini</td></tr><tr><td>GQA (Grouped-Query Attention)</td><td>Medium</td><td class=\"winner\">Fast</td><td>LLaMA 2/3, Mistral, Gemma</td></tr><tr><td>MLA (Multi-head Latent Attention)</td><td class=\"winner\">Very low</td><td>Fast</td><td>DeepSeek-V2/V3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>FlashAttention: Why Attention Doesn't Have to Be Slow</h2><p>FlashAttention reorders attention computation to avoid materializing the full n x n matrix in GPU HBM. Result: 2-4x faster attention, O(n) memory instead of O(n squared), numerically identical results. If you're running your own inference stack and not using FlashAttention, you are leaving 2-4x of free performance on the table.</p><h2>What This Means for Your System Design</h2><ul><li><strong>Context window size is a cost lever, not a free setting.</strong> Every token costs KV cache memory.</li><li><strong>Model size selection should be driven by quality-cost tradeoff for your specific task.</strong> A well-prompted 7B model with domain-specific fine-tuning often outperforms generic 70B at one-tenth the serving cost.</li><li><strong>FlashAttention is not optional in production.</strong> Verify your provider uses it.</li></ul>"
